# GYAM Roadmap Seed

- Seed from `Project_Management_Daily_Roadmap_Starting_2026-07-27.md`, then store editable DB copies.
- Start date = first day the user begins using GYAM (not fixed July 27, 2026).
- Remap original Week 1 tasks onto the user’s actual first 7 calendar days.
- Weeks 2–52 use the standard weekday routine pattern; monthly milestones stay first-class.
- Suggested study minutes come from an editable subject→minutes table.
- Sunday = guided retrospective form, not free-form only.
